{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1554162-how-bad-of-an-idea-would-it-be-to-turn-cultists-to-stone-as-a-way-of-not-losing-them","id":1554162,"title":"How bad of an idea would it be to turn cultists to stone as a way of not losing them?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-10-05T12:04:03-07:00","id":1554162,"title":"How bad of an idea would it be to turn cultists to stone as a way of not losing them?","content":"Let's say a powerful arisen is a lonely fellow and enjoys a few cultists. He already has his pet falcon he brings through every descent and his bodyguard/lover/best friend who comes with every descent. But he wants more. So, using the utterance Gilded Doom, the mummy smacks their favorite cultists and turns them to marble or gold or sapphire etc.. And if their net descent is after this, they can turn them back and boom, their old friends/sycophants are back!<br /> <br /> How bad of an idea is this on both a moral scale (assuming the mummy doesn't keep them aware of the world while stone) and on a &quot;this is going to backfire horribly&quot; scale?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28147-snailslayer","name":"Snailslayer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-10-17T05:02:10-07:00","id":1554416,"title":"","content":"Do you really need to be told that's a horrible idea?<br /> <br /> I mean, as something <b>meant</b> to backfire and make for a great story, I think it's ok. Kinda stupid, but desperate people do stupid things.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-10-17T13:07:44-07:00","id":1554428,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1554162-how-bad-of-an-idea-would-it-be-to-turn-cultists-to-stone-as-a-way-of-not-losing-them?p=1554416#post1554416\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do you really need to be told that's a horrible idea?<br /> <br /> I mean, as something <b>meant</b> to backfire and make for a great story, I think it's ok. Kinda stupid, but desperate people do stupid things.</div> </div> </div> </div>No I know it's a horrible idea that would backfire majorly. I was just wondering <i>how</i> bad of an idea it was. 1 being fork in the microwave and ten being Titanic hitting an iceberg.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28147-snailslayer","name":"Snailslayer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-10-17T15:40:34-07:00","id":1554435,"title":"","content":"It's something closer to 10.<br /> <br /> Morally you'll royally screw the lives of all those cultists and their families, to awaken them in a time and place they're not only unprepared to deal with, it's a whole group having to do so, which likely makes things even harder.<br /> <br /> This can backfire in the way that it sends a clear message to your cultists that you do horrible things to them. Depending on the context, you may expect your whole cult to betray you, and do so in a smart way as the heads of the betrayal will be people who know you from another Descent.<br /> <br /> You may end up inadvertently creating Immortals, and Immortals that will dedicate their lives to screw you.<br /> <br /> Of course, you can offset everything here by taking volunteers instead of doing it against their will or knowledge. But that's not the question as asked.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-10-18T09:14:19-07:00","id":1554448,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1554162-how-bad-of-an-idea-would-it-be-to-turn-cultists-to-stone-as-a-way-of-not-losing-them?p=1554435#post1554435\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's something closer to 10.<br /> <br /> Morally you'll royally screw the lives of all those cultists and their families, to awaken them in a time and place they're not only unprepared to deal with, it's a whole group having to do so, which likely makes things even harder.<br /> <br /> This can backfire in the way that it sends a clear message to your cultists that you do horrible things to them. Depending on the context, you may expect your whole cult to betray you, and do so in a smart way as the heads of the betrayal will be people who know you from another Descent.<br /> <br /> You may end up inadvertently creating Immortals, and Immortals that will dedicate their lives to screw you.<br /> <br /> Of course, you can offset everything here by taking volunteers instead of doing it against their will or knowledge. But that's not the question as asked.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ideally, it would involve consent and have their minds turned off so it isn't a thousand years of feeling their bodies slowly erode. But even if it was consenting it's still fucked up.<br /> <br /> And hey, they are in the same boat as the mummy lol. <br /> <br /> The &quot;ideal&quot; verison would be making the cult believe that being turned to a golden statue elevates you to a higher level of consciousness and ties you to the siant/god/whatever forever, and earns a high place in the afterlife. Mostly though it be the Mummy having grown fond of someone and carelessly pulling them from time so the mummy can selfishly hold onto someone that is indocrinated to serve them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28147-snailslayer","name":"Snailslayer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-10-18T17:39:38-07:00","id":1554457,"title":"","content":"First remember that cults live by the Mummy's ideals, not literally their every word, so convincing people of this isn't a guaranteed thing and may go wrong in many ways.<br /> <br /> Also, whatever you say to them will be confronted with whatever really happens. Cultists that are turned and then go back to normal in another time will notice they're not immortals, they still age as normal, they just got a one-way ticket to the future. If this is not what they expect, they may get pretty pissed off, and then all hell will broke loose sooner or later, probably when the Mummy is most vulnerable.<br /> <br /> But if they're consenting participants and mostly know what they're signing up to, then things get pretty tame. Sure, it'll be still a hard experience on them, but not a terrible thing to do. Is it morally reprehensible? Hard to say, they're consenting adults, is it? Will it backfire? Not more than a lot of things a Mummy does involving the cult, I wouldn't expect it to go really wrong with any regularity.<br /> <br /> Of course, in practice they'll probably not have a full, honest explanation on what will happen and what's expected from them then. But it's hard to say how close to 1 or 10 without knowing the particular method to be used. And the more honest you are with them, the less likely they are to agree in numbers, or at all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-10-27T20:34:07-07:00","id":1554710,"title":"","content":"One of the Cult's big benefits is that its members keep up with the times while the mummy sleeps; the cult may be anachronistic, but it's members aren't fossils.<br /> <br /> The followers you bring with you are, undoubtedly, going to be seen as high status leaders within the cult when they thaw out - do you really want the favored followers from centuries ago calling the shots now? Bad enough the mummy herself has to catch up - she's at least wired for immortality.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/456-blackwell","name":"Blackwell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar456_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"977"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}